ISO-10303-21;
/* Gn176: RECTANGULAR_TRIMMED_SURFACE wraps B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS (degree 2,2 3x3 net) whose weights list contains -0.15 at pole (1,1); negative weight is geometrically invalid in rational NURBS homogeneous coordinates; OCCT BRepBuilderAPI_NurbsConvert raises exception or returns null shape; defect from SolidWorks export pattern (dev.opencascade.org); RECTANGULAR_TRIMMED_SURFACE IS ADVANCED_FACE.face_geometry — OCC yields null/empty */
